{"2889330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Veil of Madness", "steam_appid": 2889330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Veil of Madness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>— Investigate a mad dream woven from trauma, and unveil the truth through card battles against inner demons!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creators of the CONARIUM, TRANSIENT, and DARKNESS WITHIN series comes an all-new work — Veil of Madness, an eerie dungeon-crawling deckbuilder. In the game, you play as a doctor who ventures into a patient’s inner world, only to discover that her coma is not an illness at all, but perhaps a shocking evolution — or a mutation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/e8093c0a5fdc9cbcef6b5bc9a506ba7c.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique cards along the way and upgrade them to boost their stats. Some cards are hidden in secret areas, while others can only be obtained by completing specific quests — so keep a close eye on the NPCs you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/9bc8c78aadcf119da7af8613777d9df9.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/9bc8c78aadcf119da7af8613777d9df9.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/9bc8c78aadcf119da7af8613777d9df9.mp4?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/01008a61d7d61157c73af0a0a3f92283.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will encounter all manner of creatures, sometimes facing several enemies at once. Use the items at your disposal wisely if you want to survive this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/cde25229fc04e2e1cc46d2d80b45295b.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/cde25229fc04e2e1cc46d2d80b45295b.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/cde25229fc04e2e1cc46d2d80b45295b.mp4?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the face of these creatures, ‘discarding’ is a lie — you are merely choosing who will hold and corrupt your thoughts instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(Cards you discard are added to your enemies’ hands. They feed on your ‘intrusive thoughts’!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/c45d2626697a9a4a694d9786265d930c.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/c45d2626697a9a4a694d9786265d930c.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/c45d2626697a9a4a694d9786265d930c.mp4?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>———— Neurologist Dr. E. Mercer’s Encrypted Medical Research Journal  ————</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/eb3f644fe8ba3f5b96059f27033f8fbb.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOG 001</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Research Subject: Sophia Reed (Day ██ of coma)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status: First deep connection with the “Revealer”</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “Revealer” connection succeeded. I saw the patient’s dream. It’s astonishing! This is an unspeakable labyrinth of consciousness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A moment ago I was in a mansion, and now I’ve arrived at a space station! The corridors echo with the cries of a baby. I tried recording the surroundings with a voice recorder, but on playback, all I heard was my own breathing. I could feel something watching me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspected trauma type: Existential loss · Maternal grief</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/5321b4c5356f59b0842fdbe936828282.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/5321b4c5356f59b0842fdbe936828282.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/5321b4c5356f59b0842fdbe936828282.mp4?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/d9c23e23e1d518b19e3e9d2cc3bd732e.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOG 002</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status: Mental stamina declining</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her second dream layer is an endless trench, the air thick with the smell of scorched metal and rust... or is it blood?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters spawned within Sophia’s dream absorb and corrupt my intrusive thoughts. I need to stay calm and think carefully about how to deal with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As I pressed deeper, I encountered Sophia’s “father.” Wait — is that a UFO and... an alien???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspected trauma type: War trauma · Delusions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/0823c02e20a4af5d38965cbce4836231.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/0823c02e20a4af5d38965cbce4836231.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/0823c02e20a4af5d38965cbce4836231.mp4?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/8c88fc1454bb5a36bd80d1510082932c.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOG 003</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status: Perceptual defense mechanism triggered</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophia’s perceptual defense mechanism has activated. I’m trapped in a circus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I just encountered a “puppet” trying to kill the “puppeteer.” Something’s wrong — something is trying to excise her humanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters from her subconscious are everywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspected trauma type: Dissociation · Loss of self-will</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/19e6ee28ddcd10faa335f83412e31620.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/19e6ee28ddcd10faa335f83412e31620.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/19e6ee28ddcd10faa335f83412e31620.mp4?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Some logs are detected as missing...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/a1f9bef7a6a22dea5585d57ccbbd7aec.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOG 007</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status: User–host consciousness fusion</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “Revealer’s” readings have become unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m no longer just an observer. Sophia’s dream is turning against me... and the rest of the institute!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If I don’t sever the connection soon—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspected ██ type: *&amp;*)&amp;…#—!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/1c4abb5acf1c4e2586ca9c91dd343335.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/1c4abb5acf1c4e2586ca9c91dd343335.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/77a39216e9bcdb0084655040a7bc98c3.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOG [REDACTED]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bzzzt... I can’t let these ██ inside her head get out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >External ██ detected</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: Link extremely █stable!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I... bzzt... can... get... out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/fa2c590f6af7590ffc685207632d6d0a.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/fa2c590f6af7590ffc685207632d6d0a.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/fa2c590f6af7590ffc685207632d6d0a.mp4?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Veil of Madness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_pa