ore_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/d9c23e23e1d518b19e3e9d2cc3bd732e.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOG 002</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status: Mental stamina declining</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her second dream layer is an endless trench, the air thick with the smell of scorched metal and rust... or is it blood?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters spawned within Sophia’s dream absorb and corrupt my intrusive thoughts. I need to stay calm and think carefully about how to deal with them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As I pressed deeper, I encountered Sophia’s “father.” Wait — is that a UFO and... an alien???</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspected trauma type: War trauma · Delusions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/0823c02e20a4af5d38965cbce4836231.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/0823c02e20a4af5d38965cbce4836231.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/0823c02e20a4af5d38965cbce4836231.mp4?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/8c88fc1454bb5a36bd80d1510082932c.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOG 003</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status: Perceptual defense mechanism triggered</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sophia’s perceptual defense mechanism has activated. I’m trapped in a circus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I just encountered a “puppet” trying to kill the “puppeteer.” Something’s wrong — something is trying to excise her humanity...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters from her subconscious are everywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspected trauma type: Dissociation · Loss of self-will</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/19e6ee28ddcd10faa335f83412e31620.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/19e6ee28ddcd10faa335f83412e31620.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/19e6ee28ddcd10faa335f83412e31620.mp4?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Some logs are detected as missing...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/a1f9bef7a6a22dea5585d57ccbbd7aec.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOG 007</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Status: User–host consciousness fusion</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “Revealer’s” readings have become unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m no longer just an observer. Sophia’s dream is turning against me... and the rest of the institute!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If I don’t sever the connection soon—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspected ██ type: *&amp;*)&amp;…#—!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/1c4abb5acf1c4e2586ca9c91dd343335.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/1c4abb5acf1c4e2586ca9c91dd343335.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/77a39216e9bcdb0084655040a7bc98c3.avif?t=1787073036\" width=600 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOG [REDACTED]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bzzzt... I can’t let these ██ inside her head get out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >External ██ detected</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: Link extremely █stable!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I... bzzt... can... get... out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/fa2c590f6af7590ffc685207632d6d0a.poster.avif?t=1787073036\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/fa2c590f6af7590ffc685207632d6d0a.webm?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889330/extras/fa2c590f6af7590ffc685207632d6d0a.mp4?t=1787073036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Veil of Madness is a first person psychological horror deckbuilder, inspired by H.P. Lovecraft's Beyond the Wall of Sleep. Explore the depths of Sophia's consciousness, collecting and upgrading cards that are your only means of combat against the creatures born from her subconscious.", "supported_languages": "Engl